{"id":"380d930cef0f","path":"/it/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects/job-profiles","lang":"it","title":"Job Profiles","description":"The Master in International Tourism equips you for a career in the international tourism industry within destination management, transportation & accommodation companies, tour…","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","MT","Career Prospects"],"image":null,"words":96,"alternates":{"it":"/it/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects/job-profiles","en":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects/job-profiles"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MT","path":"/en/education/master/international-tourism"},{"label":"Career Prospects","path":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects"},{"label":"Job Profiles","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The Master in International Tourism provides a versatile and multidisciplinary education that opens the door to a wide range of career opportunities in the global tourism sector. Combining theoretical foundations with practical experience, the programme prepares graduates to work across various professional settings, including - but not limited to - the following areas:</p> <ul> <li>Destination Management &amp; Marketing Organisations (DMOs)</li> <li>Tour Operators and (Online) Travel Agencies</li> <li>Governments and International Organisations</li> <li>Cultural and Heritage Organisations</li> <li>Meetings, Incentives, Conferences &amp; Events (MICE)</li> <li>Tourism Consultancy and Research</li> <li>Non-Governmental Organisations (NGOs)</li> <li>Tourism Industry Associations</li> <li>Corporate Travel Management</li> <li>Transportation &amp; Accommodation Companies</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"mailto:mt@usi.ch?subj